Trussline
=========

Trussline is a native Android (arm64 / Vulkan) port of the Rigs of Rods
soft-body physics simulator.

Trussline is an independent derivative work. It is NOT affiliated with,
endorsed by, or supported by the Rigs of Rods project or its maintainers.
Please do not direct Trussline bug reports, support requests, or feedback
to the upstream project.


